  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: in a @classmethod, cls.build() (inherited, cross-file) and cls.build2() (same file) both stay python:external unresolved with no linker edge, while the control self.helper() resolves to Base.helper via inherited-calls-linker (0.9). test_cls_method_gets_no_hint still exists (test_py_receiver_type_hint.py:219). Premise holds. MECHANISM: Site-1 enclosing_class hint is stamped only for receiver self, never cls. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-mosof,WI-basij."  # 37bc
